  "releaseNotes": "ChalkQL.Sources 0.6 accompanies ChalkQL 0.6.\n\n      - **POCO tables:** An index backed by a table's own order extends by the rows an append adds rather than reading every row again; on a log of 1.6 million rows, an append of 8 rows takes 0.07 ms where it took 11.5 ms.\n\n      Requires exactly ChalkQL 0.6.0.\n\n      Full release notes:\n      https://github.com/markhammond/chalkql/releases/tag/v0.6",
